WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
The next Qing Dynasty found out about the Dazhuang people

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,400
Song Ci knew Lin Lulu

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,200
Lin Lulu hit Xiaomei three times

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,200
Dazhuang gets a hair and starts

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:16,140
You didn't even look where she was going next.

6
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:22,240
Then he released the sword

7
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,640
What's the use of having more?

8
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,240
If you miss it, you set off two more fireworks.

9
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,840
Who can fly faster than a sword

10
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,060
Since you can't aim at a moving target

11
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:32,060
Why not let the sword chase on its own?

12
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:40,770
Lock on Xiaomei and chase her yourself

13
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:45,260
Only then can you pursue it yourself
